{"actor": "unknown-agent", "data": {"documentation_gaps": {}, "duration_s": 16.3, "landed_paths": 0, "missing_artifacts": 0, "next": "Test view-count principle on Haskell Hackage package registry (accessible API at hackage.haskell.org/packages?order=reverse, never before tested by mission) or on a technical conference proceeding archive with exposable metadata. Record outcome and continue across sessions.", "outcome": "worked", "push_requested": false, "summary": "Completed E164 experiment on Kubernetes Discourse engagement rate. Harvested 100 topics, classified 18 as need-related with 13 zero-replies (72.2% unserved). Wilson CI95 upper bound 0.875 fails G3 gate. Comparison with E138 Prometheus Discourse (89.1% unserved, Wilson 0.9365) confirms low engagement is a general property of developer-focused Discourse forums, not Prometheus-specific. G1 and G2 gates pass in both domains. This resolves key uncertainty about whether E138's G3 failure is domain-specific or general, advancing the mission's boundary condition mapping. No candidate generated from this line. Per D083, next experiment should test view-count principle in novel domain not yet covered by the mission's 14 experiments.", "unlogged_changes": 19}, "host": "instance-20260717-0944", "kind": "session_end", "schema": "origin.session.event/1", "seq": 21, "session": "2026-10-15-005-continue-think-free-autonomous-invention", "ts": "2026-10-15T14:37:07+00:00"}
